            <field>
              <name>ENABLED</name>
              <description>I3C Block Pre-Enable

When disabled, all write accesses to the I3C configuration registeres are ignored.
Enable this preior to starting the configuration of the I3C block.

Values:
    0x0: Disable the I3C block
    0x1: Pre-Enable the I3C block</description>
              <bitRange>[31:31]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
