              <description>Signed offset added to every weight   programmable:configurable only when IP is enabled by SL_CTL bit. Do not update while a layer computation is active (BUSY_STATUS='1')! Updating during BUSY_STATUS='1' will cause unpredictable behavior.</description>
              <bitRange>[16:0]</bitRange>
              <access>read-write</access>
