Note: For octal data transfer with DDR mode (WR_DATA_CTL.WIDTH='3' and WR_DATA_CTL.DDR_MODE='1') the number of bytes for CRC generation must be even (i.e. DATA_CRC_INPUT_SIZE must be odd).</description>
