0 (default) When read, it means that PMU_EVCNTRn is disabled. When written, it has no effect.
1 When read, it means that PMU_EVCNTRn event counter is enabled. When written, it disables PMU_EVCNTRn.</description>
                <bitRange>[0:0]</bitRange>
