              <description>Display Interrupt Register.  This is the interrupt register for the Display.  This register will automatically clear after a read.  The interrupt bit is set when the current frame buffer  is used up. The interrupt signal will be pulled up only  when the interrupt enable bit in register  gcregDisplayIntrEnable is enabled. READ ONLY. When the access comes from a debugger (HMASTER[0] == 1), the clear by read function is disabled.</description>
