                  <description>Cycle number=Setting*(DbiAcTimeUnit+1).  0: When Type A Fixed E mode: Not used.  1: When Type A Clock E mode: Time to assert E.  2: When Type B mode: Time to assert WRX.</description>
                  <bitRange>[11:8]</bitRange>
