              <field>
                <name>DFIFODEPTH</name>
                <description>DFIFO Depth (DfifoDepth - EP_LOC_CNT)

This value is in terms of 32-bit words.
 - Minimum value is 32
 - Maximum value is 32,768
Note: This field is configured using the OTG_DFIFO_DEPTH parameter. For more information on EP_LOC_CNT, see the 'Endpoint Information Controller (EPINFO_CTL)' section.</description>
                <bitRange>[31:16]</bitRange>
                <access>read-only</access>
              </field>
