              <field>
                <name>DOPNG</name>
                <description>Do Ping (DoPng)

This bit is used only for OUT transfers.
Setting this field to 1 directs the host to do PING protocol.

Note: Do not set this bit for IN transfers. If this bit is set for for IN transfers it disables the channel.</description>
