              <field>
                <name>PID</name>
                <description>PID (Pid)

The application programs this field with the type of PID to use for the initial transaction. The host maintains this field for the rest of the transfer.
 - 2'b00: DATA0
 - 2'b01: DATA2
 - 2'b10: DATA1
 - 2'b11: MDATA (non-control)/SETUP (control)</description>
